                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "DO NOT PLAY IF YOU ARE PHOTOSENSITIVE!!! \r\n\r\nI love so much about this, but I do have to give that disclaimer. There are sequences with flashing lights that are straight up inaccessible to folks with photosensitivity. Irresponsible on the part of the developer and I hope to see them develop past that artistically.\r\n\r\n\r\nShort of that, this game is phenomnenal. It is a beautiful journey through strange, massive, liminal spaces. There are wonderful puzzles and artfully designed landscapes, beautiful, curious moments, and artfully masterful scenes. I reccomend this to anybody that wants a sold backrooms-type adventure them up and isn't afraid of a walking simulator that doesn't hold your hand and gives you room to absorb the vibes.",
